# Copy to wifi.secrets (gitignored) to supply credentials to `make flash-wifi`.
# The interactive CLI (examples/cli) does not need this file: it asks over serial
# and can store the credentials in on-chip flash.
#
# Passwords with spaces, quotes, or make metacharacters (#, $, \) are awkward
# here. Use the CLI for those, or pass -ldflags yourself with proper shell quoting.
WIFI_SSID=your-ssid
WIFI_PASS=your-password
